WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.542
Taking photos is

00:00:01.542 --> 00:00:02.792
something that I do

00:00:02.792 --> 00:00:05.040
to keep my inner child alive.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.330
 I love it, I'm Petra Collins,
and I'm a fashion photographer

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.290
and director.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:11.910
You look gorgeous.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:14.220
In this class, I'm going
to show you guys how

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.873
to operate your camera,

00:00:16.873 --> 00:00:17.873
how to take portraits,

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.960
considering lighting,
location, and composition.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.610
Photography doesn't
have to be complicated.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:25.620
Have fun with it.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.982
Move really fast.

00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:27.690
That's beautiful.

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:28.530
[LAUGHS]

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.872
You have the power to create

00:00:29.872 --> 00:00:32.038
images that no one has ever seen before.

00:00:32.246 --> 00:00:33.510
Like you guys there.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.560
[MUSIC PLAYING]

